sequenceDiagram
    participant G as FPSGame
    participant HC as HumanoidCharacter
    participant AP as AnimationPlayer
    participant IK as IK Solver
    participant CS as CollisionSystem
    participant SR as SkeletonRenderer
    participant R as Renderer

    Note over G: Each Frame

    G->>HC: update(dt, pos, rot, speed, ground_h)
    HC->>AP: evaluate(dt)
    AP-->>HC: local_transforms[]

    HC->>HC: compute_world_transforms()

    HC->>CS: ground_height_at(foot_x, foot_z)
    CS-->>HC: ground_y

    HC->>IK: solve_two_bone_ik(hip, knee, foot, target)
    IK-->>HC: adjusted rotations

    HC->>SR: skeleton_to_renderables(skel, transforms)
    SR-->>HC: bone_entities[]

    HC->>SR: attachment_to_renderables("right_hand_grip", gun)
    SR-->>HC: gun_entities[]

    G->>G: rebuild_renderables()
    G->>R: draw(all_entities)
